        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-frames-r5-02-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "从 … 起",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "从…起 marks the starting point of an interval that follows. It does not mark the destination where an action ends.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "从今天起，我每天学习。",
                "pinyin": "cóng jīntiān qǐ ， wǒ měi tiān xuéxí 。",
                "meaning": "Starting today, I study every day.",
                "audio": "db90d918d55af1cbad047f48292372958d80b59149c6b7c4eda6bfaf8f416ef3"
              },
              {
                "text": "从明天起，他在家工作。",
                "pinyin": "cóng míngtiān qǐ ， tā zài jiā gōngzuò 。",
                "meaning": "Starting tomorrow, he works from home.",
                "audio": "29609c53bf457674c5e8848fe79ad4cce7f9a8e3e1872ea5d8951b517e239ef8"
              }
